      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAURLEN GRACE (1) produced a good effort in her last-start fourth when resuming at Echuca two weeks ago. Should be improved by that and is well served by the ace draw. JUST MY LUCK (9) after racing outside the leader at the bell scored a game win last start by 2.5 metres at this track over 1690m after an encouraging second placing the start before. Recent effort is good enough to put him right in the finish. CAPTAINS RUSH (2) made a nice return at her latest appearance a week-and-a-half ago, finishing 3.5 metres away in third over 2180m at Kilmore. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Leading hope in this comparable race.  WHERES WOOD WOOD (6) is worth some thought after her last-start fifth over 1755m at Echuca on November 4 when after getting caught wide early battled on well to the line.",
